<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <%~ include('./_dark-scheme-head.html.eta') %>
  <title>Exercises have moved — <%~ it.cohortName %> <%~ it.season %></title>
</head>
<body bgcolor="#111111" style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#111111; font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;">

  <!-- Full-width background -->
  <table bgcolor="#111111" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#111111; padding:24px 0;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <!-- Main card -->
        <table bgcolor="#1b1b1b" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#1b1b1b; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;">
          <!-- Header strip -->
          <tr>
            <td bgcolor="#000000" align="center" style="background-color:#000000; padding:24px 24px 20px 24px;">
              <h1 style="margin:0; font-size:22px; color:#ffffff; font-weight:700;">
                Exercises have moved
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:8px 0 0 0; font-size:14px; color:#f9b233; font-weight:500;">
                <%~ it.cohortName %> <%~ it.season %>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body copy -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:24px 32px 16px 32px; color:#eaeaea; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
                Hi <strong style="color:#ffd580;"><%~ it.userName %></strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
                From <strong style="color:#ffd580;"><%~ it.switchedOn %></strong>, exercises for <strong style="color:#ffd580;"><%~ it.cohortName %> <%~ it.season %></strong> run on the Bitshala classroom instead of GitHub Classroom.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">
                Work you push to your GitHub Classroom repositories from now on <strong style="color:#ffd580;">will not be graded</strong>. The results GitHub Classroom already recorded are kept, and nothing you do on the Bitshala classroom can lower them.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
                You'll find this and every remaining week's exercise on your Assignments page:
              </p>

              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td bgcolor="#f97316" style="background-color:#f97316; border-radius:8px;">
                    <a href="<%~ it.assignmentsUrl %>" style="display:inline-block; padding:12px 20px; color:#ffffff; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">Open my assignments</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0; font-weight:500;">
                Happy hacking!
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer / sign-off -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 32px 28px 32px; color:#b3b3b3; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">
              <p style="margin:0;">
                <strong style="color:#eaeaea;"><%~ it.cohortName %> TAs</strong>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
        <!-- /Main card -->

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
